# Harmat — a database layer for Kex, in the way Drizzle writes queries.
#
# Tables are declared in Kex (Harmat.Table), queries are built against them
# (Harmat.Database) and sent through a capability an application installs
# its database as (Harmat.Connection), and the schema is kept current with
# migrations that are data (Harmat.Migration). Everything reaches the
# database through one ODBC boundary (Harmat.Odbc) in standard SQL, so
# SQLite and PostgreSQL are the same to it. README.md is the guide.
module Harmat do
  export Harmat.Schema
  export Harmat.Query
  export Harmat.Sql
  export Harmat.Odbc
  export Harmat.Column
  export Harmat.Migration
  export Harmat.Table
  export Harmat.Database
  export Harmat.Confined
  export Harmat.Log
  export Harmat.Connection
end
